        "quote": "(b) An employee sued for an act or omission that arose in the scope of the employee’s duty shall submit a request to the City Attorney, in writing, to provide for his/her defense. Such request shall be delivered within 15 days after service of process upon the employee. The employee shall reasonably cooperate in good faith in any defense provided by the City. (Ord. 20183 § 7, 5-21-19.)",
